  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: Unnumbered Site Location Plan, 546_751 Rev C, Cover Letter, Fire Safety Statement received 20 October 2023..",
    "Condition : 3 - Notwithstanding the submitted details, the premises shall not be used as Class E(f) (Cr?che, day nursery or day centre (not including a residential use)), E(g)(ii) (Research and development of products or processes) and E(g)(iii) (Industrial processes) without prior written permission of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to the commencement of any use under Class E(d) (Indoor sport, recreation or fitness (not involving motorised vehicles or firearms or use as a swimming pool or skating rink,)) a scheme for protecting the approved development from noise associated with the use has been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. The submitted details shall include full details of a scheme to insulate the premises against internally generated airborne and impact sound to the residential accommodation above. The approved scheme shall be completed before the development is first occupied or brought into use and be retained as such thereafter.",
    "Condition : 5 - If the premises is operating as a Class E(a) Display or retail sale of goods, other than hot food or E(d) Indoor sport, recreation or fitness (not involving motorised vehicles or firearms or use as a swimming pool or skating rink,) unit;  Customers shall only be permitted on the premises between the following hours:\n06:00 - 23:00 Mondays -  Fridays and;\n07:00 - 22:00 Saturdays, Sundays and Bank Holidays",
    "Condition : 6 - If the premises is operating as a Class E(b) Sale of food and drink for consumption (mostly) on the premises unit;  Customers shall only be permitted on the premises between the following hours:\n09:00 - 22:00 Sundays - Thursdays and;\n09:00 - 23:00 Fridays - Saturdays.",
    "Condition : 7 - If the premises is operating as a Class E(c) Financial services, Professional services (other than health or medical services), Other appropriate services in a commercial, business or service locality, Class E(e) Provision of medical or health services (except the use of premises attached to the residence of the consultant or practitioner) or E(g)(i) Offices to carry out any operational or administrative functions Customers shall only be permitted on the premises between the following hours:\n08:00 - 20:00 Mondays - Fridays and;\n09:00 - 17:00  Saturdays - Sundays."
  ],
